    "preamble": "Mohan vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 31 August, 2023 Author: Anil Verma Bench: Anil Verma 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Indore Mcrc No. 38933 of 2023 (Mohan Vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh) Dated : 31-08-2023 Shri Pourush Ranka- Advocate for the petitioner. Shri D.G. Mishra -Ga for the respondent/State.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that private complaint has been filed under section 7 and 16 of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 and the charge has been framed under the same Act by the trial Court, but the aforesaid Act has been abolished and new law namely Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 has been enacted.",
